    {l:'በ–ቦ',say:'one consonant carries seven vowel orders: በ (bä) ቡ (bu) ቢ (bi) ባ (ba) ቤ (be) ብ (bə) ቦ (bo)',ex:'ቤት = bet (house)',voice:'ቤት'},
    {l:'ኦ (o)',say:'the long "o" vowel, as in go',ex:'ቡና = buna (coffee)',voice:'ቡና'}
