        {t:'chal',en:'Pleased to meet you',tr:'ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ',pr:'tu-HAA-noon mil ke khu-SHEE HO-ee',morph:['tuhanu mil ke = to meet you','khushi hoi = (I am) happy']}
